BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Petaluma Annual Trick or Treat Trail
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T173000
UID:d3f2ec9aa967da09e7397f8deac47e1d@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:A time of bats and broomsticks\, blood and bugs - and Downtown
  Petaluma’s Safe “Trick or Treat Trail” with the downtown Merchants!
  Parents - gather your little ghosts\, goblins\, monsters\, Harry Potters\
 , witches on broomsticks and princesses\, and join the participating downt
 own merchants for the Annual Trick or Treat Trail this Halloween\, Saturda
 y\, October 31 ~ from 3-5:30 pm! Visit the website after October 24 to dow
 nload the pumpkin trail map - listing all participating locations on Kentu
 cky St\, 4th St\, Western Ave\, Petaluma Blvd\, 2nd St\, “C” St\, Thea
 ter Square\, and the River Plaza Shopping Center. Over 75 businesses will 
 be handing out Halloween candy to costumed children. Participating merchan
 ts will have signage placed outside their stores as noted on the map. Come
  and celebrate a safe and spooktacular time in our wonderful downtown!
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/downtown-petaluma-
 annual-trick-or-treat-trail
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Speed Networking Mixer - brought to you by the Ambassador Committe
 e of the Petaluma Area Chamber of Commerce
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T183000
UID:49760d0e1598979dd5658e47ff9efd3f@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow professionals for a fast-paced speed networking mi
 xer designed to help you make meaningful connections in a fun and relaxed 
 environment. Expand your network\, share your story\, and discover new opp
 ortunities\, one conversation at a time. Light appetizers and a no-host ba
 r will be available after the timed rounds of networking. Register Now! Sp
 ace is Limited.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/speed-networking
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In-Between Spaces: Author Conversation with Louise Leff
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T200000
UID:f7e1c75a8b4e98e4b7f44d7d18e49e09@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Featuring more than 90 photographs of gardens and landscapes\,
  explore local author Louise Leff's book as it looks closely at the moment
 s that connect one space to another and the many ways those transitions in
 fluence how we see and experience a garden. "The spaces between one garden
  area and another are often overlooked\, yet they can be some of the most 
 memorable parts of a landscape." - Louise Leff
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/in-between-spaces-
 author-conversation-with-louise-leff
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
